# The DimeShift application source, pinned to the revision the benchmark's Docker image was
# built from. See benchmark/dimeshift/README.md for why the pin matters.
#
# This mapping was MISSING until 2026-09-04: benchmark/dimeshift/dimeshift had been committed as
# a gitlink (mode 160000, commit 440898e) since e5ef8d2 "added initial version of autoe2e and
# e2ebench", but with no .gitmodules entry. Git therefore had a submodule pointer it could not
# resolve: `git submodule update` failed with "no submodule mapping found", recursive clones
# produced an empty directory, and the recorded revision was effectively unreachable.
#
# The pointer itself was never wrong -- 440898e8e48b9a85f4d3c7dfa374e4abd7e27423 is exactly
# refs/heads/master of the upstream below (verified 2026-09-04). Only the mapping was absent, so
# this is a repair, not a re-pin: the commit is unchanged.
[submodule "benchmark/dimeshift/dimeshift"]
	path = benchmark/dimeshift/dimeshift
	url = https://github.com/jeka-kiselyov/dimeshift.git
